{"ticker":"SAMMAANCAP","symbol":"SAMMAANCAP","instrumentId":3125983,"name":"Sammaan Capital","industry":"NSE-Finance-Consumer Loans","about":"Sammaan Capital Ltd. is a financial services company dedicated to promoting financial inclusion through micro-leasing and asset financing solutions. The company primarily serves low-income individuals, entrepreneurs, and small businesses by providing affordable financing options for essential assets, including e-rickshaws, agricultural equipment, and small machinery. Sammaan Capital aims to empower underserved communities by facilitating access to income-generating assets, enabling them to improve their livelihoods and achieve financial independence. The company’s innovative approach combines technology and financial expertise to deliver seamless and accessible financing solutions, supporting the growth of micro-entrepreneurs and fostering economic development in rural and urban areas across India.","website":"www.sammaancapital.com","location":"INDIA","exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:55:18.067Z","basis":"consolidated","price":{"value":128.69,"changePct":0.15565413650866886,"week52High":184.28,"week52Low":112.56},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹16,092 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹7,017 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"837,804,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"212"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"297,089,681"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"3.30%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"0.78"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"0.9"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"—"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"-0.06"},{"label":"Beta","value":"1.39"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"-7%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"—"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"4–12"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"-37.6%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"107.56"},{"label":"Volume","value":"6,238,223"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"5,627,443"},{"label":"Master score","value":"34"},{"label"